{"unit_id":"HuaGyuu__dsh-runner#readme-1","repo":"HuaGyuu/dsh-runner","commit":"68b8999f1020d3aa115ada458d398511f636e3c9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-runner README · dsh-runner：> DeepSeek Harness 左侧栏的「运行项」面板：为每个项指定一个目录和一条命令，点运行就像在该目录打开 cmd 执行；输出实时可见，随时可终止。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-runner"}
{"unit_id":"HuaGyuu__dsh-runner#readme-2","repo":"HuaGyuu/dsh-runner","commit":"68b8999f1020d3aa115ada458d398511f636e3c9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-runner README · 功能：- **多个运行项**：每项各自绑定工作目录与命令，互不干扰。\n- **一键运行 / 停止 / 重启**：停止时结束整棵进程树，不留孤儿进程。\n- **实时日志**：按字节偏移增量拉取，长输出不卡界面。\n- **命令历史与状态持久化**：保存在 `$DSH_HOME/dsh-runner/`（运行项、历史、`logs/<runId>.log`）。\n- **中英文界面**：随界面语言自动切换。","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"HuaGyuu__dsh-runner#readme-3","repo":"HuaGyuu/dsh-runner","commit":"68b8999f1020d3aa115ada458d398511f636e3c9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-runner README · 安装：需要 DeepSeek Harness `>= 0.2.0-rc.1`。把示例里的 `web` 换成你实际使用的 profile 名。\n\n方式一 · 直接从 GitHub 安装：\n\n```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:HuaGyuu/dsh-runner\n```\n\n方式二 · 克隆到本地再安装：\n\n```powershell\ngit clone https://github.com/HuaGyuu/dsh-runner.git\ndsh plugin --profile web add ./dsh-runner\n```\n\n安装后在左侧栏即可看到「运行项」面板。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"HuaGyuu__dsh-runner#readme-4","repo":"HuaGyuu/dsh-runner","commit":"68b8999f1020d3aa115ada458d398511f636e3c9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-runner README · 使用：1. 在面板中新建运行项：填写名称、工作目录、命令（例如 `pnpm dev`）。\n2. 点「运行」，日志实时滚动；点「停止」结束整个进程树，点「重启」重新拉起。\n3. 命令按原样交给 PowerShell 执行，支持 `npm run build && node serve.js` 这类组合命令。","source":"extracted","section":"使用"}
{"unit_id":"HuaGyuu__dsh-runner#readme-5","repo":"HuaGyuu/dsh-runner","commit":"68b8999f1020d3aa115ada458d398511f636e3c9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-runner README · 开发与测试：`harness/` 内是冒烟测试，直接跑：\n\n```powershell\npwsh -File ./harness/run-smoke.ps1\n```","source":"extracted","section":"开发与测试"}
{"unit_id":"HuaGyuu__dsh-runner#readme-6","repo":"HuaGyuu/dsh-runner","commit":"68b8999f1020d3aa115ada458d398511f636e3c9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-runner README · 目录结构：```\nindex.js            宿主半侧入口（注册 webServer 路由）\nserver/index.js     HTTP 路由与请求校验\nserver/runner.js    运行项与进程管理（不依赖 Cordis）\nclient.js           浏览器半侧（侧栏面板）","source":"extracted","section":"目录结构"}
